;=============================================================================
; ddkEngineKite.per -- BASELINE probe: no DUC at all, just the ENGINE's own
; built-in kiting, discovered in the official "AI (HD version).per" (~7076-7085):
;   ability-to-maintain-distance 0  -> 0 = kite (100 = stay)
;   ability-to-dodge-missiles   0  -> 0 = dodge
; A/B this against ddkMicroV1 / Immortal in the same arena: it answers "does the
; ENGINE kite already handle walls/corners well enough?" for free.
;=============================================================================
(defrule
	(true)
	=>
	(set-difficulty-parameter ability-to-maintain-distance 0)
	(set-difficulty-parameter ability-to-dodge-missiles 0)
	(disable-self)
)
